  "body": "Found in the review of PR #2320 (issue #2319).\n\nWhat is missing: the test `a_repaired_default_machine_file_is_read_again_and_a_good_one_is_kept` checks `KeptMachine` with a given reader. It does not call `default_mch_text` (`crates/app/src/posting_files.rs`). The reviewer put the old text cache back into `default_mch_text`. All 9 tests of `default_machine_missing` passed, but the real path gave Err, Err, Err for the sequence: missing file, `{}`, good file.\n\nEffect of a regression: the post refuses until a restart after a repaired file. No wrong program is posted.\n\nDone means: one test goes through `default_machine_checked` with files on disk (missing, then `{}`, then the good file) and gets Err, Err, Ok. The test fails when `default_mch_text` keeps a text.\n",
